    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Railroad Scheduler</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlisting Railroad Scheduler is the best way to support us as it boosts the game's visibility on Steam and ensures you won't miss its demo and release!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Time, Lead Trains!</h2>Take full control of time on the rails. Speed up or slow down the action to manage your trains with precision. Refine your strategy and adjust the timeline to ensure every train reaches its destination flawlessly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/6b34d7a88eb99b83bdbc7d369144a9c5.poster.avif?t=1744063453\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/6b34d7a88eb99b83bdbc7d369144a9c5.webm?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/6b34d7a88eb99b83bdbc7d369144a9c5.mp4?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Orchestrate Schedules in Real-Time</h2>Step into the role of a master scheduler as you manage multiple trains simultaneously. React to challenges on the fly and keep everything running smoothly. Ensure every train reaches its destination without a hitch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/a3afa8857b3389debd5b50c10ad74f68.poster.avif?t=1744063453\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/a3afa8857b3389debd5b50c10ad74f68.webm?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/a3afa8857b3389debd5b50c10ad74f68.mp4?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fix Crashes by Rewinding Time</h2>Accidents happen, but you can set things right! Use the rewind feature to undo crashes and correct mistakes. Rewind and adjust your strategy to avoid collisions and keep your trains on track.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/f98804fb1c8104b225851e3ec6f33b3f.poster.avif?t=1744063453\" width=622 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/f98804fb1c8104b225851e3ec6f33b3f.webm?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/f98804fb1c8104b225851e3ec6f33b3f.mp4?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Rails!</h2>Take command of the railway system and showcase your skills. Navigate complex tracks, manage schedules, and use time control to perfect every route. Overcome challenges, avoid collisions, and become the ultimate railroad scheduler.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Started as a Game Jam</h2>Discover a game born from a game jam. Experience a unique creation crafted entirely without a traditional engine. Dive into a game where every element is built from the ground up.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control Time, Lead Trains!</h2>Take full control of time on the rails. Speed up or slow down the action to manage your trains with precision. Refine your strategy and adjust the timeline to ensure every train reaches its destination flawlessly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/6b34d7a88eb99b83bdbc7d369144a9c5.poster.avif?t=1744063453\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/6b34d7a88eb99b83bdbc7d369144a9c5.webm?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/6b34d7a88eb99b83bdbc7d369144a9c5.mp4?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Orchestrate Schedules in Real-Time</h2>Step into the role of a master scheduler as you manage multiple trains simultaneously. React to challenges on the fly and keep everything running smoothly. Ensure every train reaches its destination without a hitch!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/a3afa8857b3389debd5b50c10ad74f68.poster.avif?t=1744063453\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/a3afa8857b3389debd5b50c10ad74f68.webm?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/a3afa8857b3389debd5b50c10ad74f68.mp4?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fix Crashes by Rewinding Time</h2>Accidents happen, but you can set things right! Use the rewind feature to undo crashes and correct mistakes. Rewind and adjust your strategy to avoid collisions and keep your trains on track.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/f98804fb1c8104b225851e3ec6f33b3f.poster.avif?t=1744063453\" width=622 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/f98804fb1c8104b225851e3ec6f33b3f.webm?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820250/extras/f98804fb1c8104b225851e3ec6f33b3f.mp4?t=1744063453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Rails!</h2>Take command of the railway system and showcase your skills. Navigate complex tracks, manage schedules, and use time control to perfect every route. Overcome challenges, avoid collisions, and become the ultimate railroad scheduler.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Started as a Game Jam</h2>Discover a game born from a game jam. Experience a unique creation crafted entirely without a traditional engine. Dive into a game where every element is built from the ground up.",
